   "default": "Your symptoms are most likely due to the <span>Muscular Imbalance</span> in knee. Muscular imbalance in the knees happens when some muscles are stronger or tighter than others, causing uneven stress and potential injury. This can result from repetitive activities like running or squatting, poor posture, and muscle weakness due to a sedentary lifestyle. With a proper self-care routine, you can prevent further damage and reverse some of the damage already done. The betterhood<sup>TM</sup> routine focuses on targeted muscle strengthening and postural correction to alleviate shoulder misalignment, reduce excessive loading, and enhance bone density and tissue recovery."
